        <dc:title>Smalls, Talls and All</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Warbaum, Joshiah" opf:role="aut">Warbaum, Joshiah</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2018-07-10T00:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;Our first foray into something a little different, "Smalls, Talls and All" begs the question: "Does size matter?"   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To some, size is no barrier to having a good time with someone else. This anthology features a whopping sixteen stories to browse, with something for fans of macro and micro content, realistic size difference, and everything between.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some like it tall, some like it small, others like it all...no matter your preference, we've got you covered!&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
